# 基本図形編集のメニューの屑実身操作を、デスクトップの図形編集とプロセスの図形編集で同じに使う
# (design 11.3), for tools/ui_run.py. A figure (mkbig fig 1 2 0) opened at 100,100 to
# 900,700; its menu opens with the item chosen last on the pointer's row, the rows 20 apart:
# in the desktop's figure 閉じる, 屑実身操作 ten rows under; in the process's, the system's
# menus remembering, 屑実身操作. Either brings up the desktop's 屑実身操作 window, which is
# closed again.
# Keys: Ctrl+E 08 01.
# the desktop's figure editor opened by open, whatever the program object says (figproc kernel)
figproc kernel
mkbig fig 1 2 0
open big
waitwin 画用紙 600
sync 600
wait 500
click 600 400 1
wait 500
move 610 600
wait 400
click 610 600
wait 800
sync 600
win 屑実身操作
shot trc_k
key 08 01
sync 600
wait 300
key 08 01
sync 600
wait 500
mkbig fig 1 2 0
logmark
pfig big
expectsincein 60 figure: opened 画用紙 shapes 3
wait 800
logmark
click 600 400 1
expectsince figure: menu
wait 500
move 610 400
wait 400
shot trc_p_menu
click 610 400
expectsince figure: trash asked 0
wait 800
sync 600
win 屑実身操作
shot trc_p
key 08 01
sync 600
